{%- comment -%}
  The plain-text summary people paste into a group chat: each person's
  share, a note that those shares already include tax, tip, fees, and
  discounts, then the bill link. It only formats: every amount comes from
  the template data. See templateData.ts for the fields, and
  renderSummary.ts for the filters available.

  The bill's own amounts (subtotal, tax, tip, fees, and total) are left out
  on purpose. Readers took them as amounts to pay on top of their own
  share, so each person gets one number, and the link opens the full
  breakdown. The note names only what this bill has, so it never mentions
  a tip that wasn't added.

  The bill link, when there is one, goes last, on its own line after a
  blank line, so chat apps show it as a link preview.

  The bill's name and each person's share are bold. `bold` makes text bold
  in the rich-text copy and leaves plain text alone.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign included = "" -%}
{%- if totals.tax != 0 %}{% assign included = included | append: ",tax" %}{% endif -%}
{%- if totals.tip != 0 %}{% assign included = included | append: ",tip" %}{% endif -%}
{%- assign has_fee = false -%}
{%- assign has_discount = false -%}
{%- for fee in totals.fees -%}
  {%- if fee.amount > 0 %}{% assign has_fee = true %}{% elsif fee.amount < 0 %}{% assign has_discount = true %}{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if has_fee %}{% assign included = included | append: ",fees" %}{% endif -%}
{%- if has_discount %}{% assign included = included | append: ",discounts" %}{% endif -%}
{% if name != "" %}{{ name | bold }}{% else %}{{ "Bill split" | bold }}{% endif %}
{% for person in people %}
{{ person.name }}: {{ person.total | money | bold }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- if included != "" %}
{%- assign verb = " are" %}
{%- if included == ",tax" or included == ",tip" %}{% assign verb = " is" %}{% endif %}
{%- assign parts = included | remove_first: "," | split: "," %}

{% for part in parts -%}
  {%- if forloop.first %}{{ part | capitalize }}{% elsif forloop.last and forloop.length > 2 %}, and {{ part }}{% elsif forloop.last %} and {{ part }}{% else %}, {{ part }}{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ verb }} included.
{%- endif %}
{%- if link != "" %}

{{ link }}
{%- endif %}
